Use Si standard PAW PBE: `$VASP_PP/potpaw_PBE/Si/POTCAR`.
Verify ENMAX with `grep ENMAX POTCAR`; ENCUT=400 eV should be
≥ 1.3 × ENMAX (Si standard ENMAX ~245 eV).

