+-procedures: Generated VASP project inputs for SCF (`8x8x8` Gamma-centered, `ENCUT=400 eV`, `EDIFF=1e-6`, `ISMEAR=0`, `SIGMA=0.05`, `LCHARG=.TRUE.`, `KPAR=2`, `NCORE=4`) and non-SCF band calculation (`ICHARG=11`, 36 points/segment line-mode `L-G-X-W-K-G` path), using Si standard PAW PBE POTCAR from `/home/werner/Public/hpc/vasp/pot/potpaw_PBE/Si/POTCAR`. Submitted the single-node SLURM chain as job `26534` with `oneapi/2024.2.0`, `vasp/6.6.0-oneapi.2024.2.0`, `--nodes=1 --ntasks=1 --cpus-per-task=8`, and `mpirun -np "${SLURM_CPUS_PER_TASK}"`; parsed bands with pymatgen `BSVasprun` plus direct `EIGENVAL` extraction for plotting.
+- generated data: `OUTCAR_scf`, `OUTCAR_band`, `vasprun_scf.xml`, `vasprun_band.xml`, `EIGENVAL`, `band_analysis.json`, `stage_times.tsv`, `module_list.txt`, `perf_append.out`; SCF converged in 13 electronic iterations, SLURM job `26534` completed with exit `0:0`, and `/home/werner/fermilink/vasp-demo/perf_log.jsonl` received one `Si_diamond_PBE_band_vasp` line.
