+- prompt: Compute the electronic band structure of bulk silicon diamond (`a=5.43 Angstrom`, 2 atoms primitive cell) with VASP 6.6.0 PBE along L-G-X-W-K-G, cross-validating against the QE baseline in `~/fermilink/qe-demo/projects/2026-05-01-si-bands-qe/`.
